Ungrouped output is preserved. Invalid CSV exits with code 2 and a useful stderr message without a traceback. Processing remains separate from argument parsing. README includes the grouped example and expected output.

All 10 supplied tests passed unchanged. Additional precision and malformed CSV checks passed.
